6393090_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CxQiQeiSrcYQ7kNvwHp_rjx&_nc_oc=Adqe9O_nqtNBunQRFVYmdNZKs0uhnbhCvNgaiQzHUfGT1_j8CeYIphfp9mOSU9abQ-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzaDPNcOHgnk8qvP97zH5Uxj-yvIrf63aC4k8ERjKpVJw&oe=69C13976"}, {"file_name": "magiclab.png", "id": "571678028809339", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_571678032142672_4802457235566616749_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJqhBMqj5BIQ7kNvwG0LGph&_nc_oc=AdrkbAzBUDHrYOeazJ9OU_8PwsNjVD-P2pBAzQt8FF-XEMXpY0NyQuLvZ-glz4ypZXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzAuWwO4kB8XT0YU-4-bXnhNvCoAQyKr5rySAdUchJ6FQ&oe=69C142F3"}, {"file_name": "Store Images-6.png", "id": "1345003753277335", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307555_1345003756610668_1826594110833715176_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7lQrwb--nwkQ7kNvwGUYWR-&_nc_oc=AdqkobZmWb24XVzJ_QlYSMOAXW4PenWxp_kYSeJkyLvRnQfN95CVor6-xBfahAnmrpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxEOuaaW7RKTwSB2NkUMeHwaLK6fdwj4UQ7gIJ5jTMQdw&oe=69C14DFE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizard Simulator", "keywords": ["magic", "wand", "duel", "wizard", "rpg"], "long_description": "# Master Magic Spells\nHarness the power of your wand to cast incredible spells with precision. Summon fire, control the elements, and unlock new magical abilities as you explore a mystical world.\n\n# Brew Powerful Potions\nDive into the art of potion-making! Combine rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and create potions that heal, enhance, or devastate in the heat of battle.\n\n# Duel Other Players\nOutsmart your opponents with quick reflexes and strategic spellcasting in intense multiplayer battles.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate wizard?\n\n{1411794410259308}", "short_description": "Cast magic spells, brew powerful potions, and duel other players in epi